cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, report or data, please cite them as below."
title: "Continuous random walk (CRW) particle dispersion UDF for ANSYS Fluent: an implementation of Dehbi (2008)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Karbakhsh Ravari"
    given-names: "Sina"
    affiliation: "Shiraz University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-6017-8628"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sina-karbakhsh/crw-dehbi-2008-fluent-udf"
abstract: >-
  ANSYS Fluent user-defined function (C) implementing the continuous random
  walk (CRW) particle dispersion model of Dehbi (2008), applied to aerosol
  deposition in a 90-degree pipe bend, with a technical report, the
  deposition data, a plotting script and a statistical test of the
  random-number generator.
license: MIT
